{
  "_note": [
    "Fixtures for the local-emergency and evacuation-order family (R5).",
    "'real' holds products captured verbatim from api.weather.gov/alerts on 2026-07-26. Nothing",
    "in them is edited: they are the source of truth for what senderName, geometry, affectedZones",
    "and parameters actually contain on a CIV-originated product. They cover every senderName",
    "shape observed nationally: a COG number prefix, a segment repeated three times, a plain",
    "agency name, and an NWS office as the genuine sender.",
    "'shaped' holds 911 Telephone Outage and Evacuation Immediate records. These are NOT",
    "archived products. api.weather.gov/alerts carries roughly seven days and held zero records",
    "for either string, nationally, on 2026-07-26. Every field name, field set and value shape",
    "here is copied from the real CIV products above (EAS-ORG CIV, no VTEC, null ends, prose",
    "areaDesc); only the county, the polygon and the alternate-number text differ, and the two",
    "phone formats are the two that appear verbatim in the real Idaho products."
